WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.760
Signed up for more than one spot? Tell us who's working each one.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:08.597
Your volunteer page shows a card for that game.

00:00:08.797 --> 00:00:13.010
Tap Name my spots. The link is in your Hub email too.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:22.117
The page lists each spot that still needs a name. Everyone needs their own paperwork, and one person can work only one spot at a time.

00:00:22.317 --> 00:00:24.870
Each spot gets its own card.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.582
Working one of them yourself? Check I'm working this spot, on that one.

00:00:29.782 --> 00:00:34.519
For each other spot, enter the person's first and last name, email, and phone.

00:00:34.719 --> 00:00:37.237
Spots that already have a name show underneath.

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:39.150
Tap Save.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.750
That's it. They're on the schedule. If their paperwork is missing, the Hub emails them the link to upload it.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.540
Questions? Email the IU liaison from the bottom of any Hub page.
